{
  "uid": "conta-spi-fake",
  "title": "Conta Digital: spi-fake",
  "description": "Simulador do SPI (Fase 3, seção 4.5 e ADR-0007): RED, liquidações, respostas seguradas, consultas de status, comportamento em vigor, logs e traces. Provisionado como código: edite o JSON, não a interface.",
  "tags": [
    "conta-digital",
    "spi-fake",
    "fase-3"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "SpiService (RED)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Chamadas por segundo",
      "description": "Settle e GetSettlement, por código de resposta. DEADLINE_EXCEEDED no Settle = o cliente desistiu (modos sem responder).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (rpc_method, rpc_response_status_code) (rate(rpc_server_call_duration_seconds_count{job=\"spi-fake\",rpc_method=~\"conta.spi.v1.SpiService/.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{rpc_method}} {{rpc_response_status_code}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Falhas do servidor (% das chamadas)",
      "description": "Inclui as falhas simuladas (UNAVAILABLE da consulta) e os timeouts dos modos sem responder.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * (sum by (rpc_method) (rate(rpc_server_call_duration_seconds_count{job=\"spi-fake\",rpc_method=~\"conta.spi.v1.SpiService/.*\",rpc_response_status_code=~\"UNKNOWN|DEADLINE_EXCEEDED|INTERNAL|UNAVAILABLE|DATA_LOSS\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) / sum by (rpc_method) (rate(rpc_server_call_duration_seconds_count{job=\"spi-fake\",rpc_method=~\"conta.spi.v1.SpiService/.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{rpc_method}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latência p99",
      "description": "Inclui a latência simulada e o tempo que os modos sem responder seguram a chamada.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, rpc_method) (rate(rpc_server_call_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"spi-fake\",rpc_method=~\"conta.spi.v1.SpiService/.*\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{rpc_method}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Liquidações",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Liquidações por minuto",
      "description": "Por status registrado; replay = repetição pelo mesmo settlement_id (o resultado registrado é devolvido, nunca muda).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "60 * sum by (spi_status, spi_replay) (rate(spi_settlements_total{job=\"spi-fake\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{spi_status}} (replay={{spi_replay}})"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Respostas seguradas",
      "description": "Settle que o simulador não respondeu de propósito, por modo. O transfers vê timeout e segue a seção 4.5.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (spi_settle_mode) (rate(spi_settle_held_total{job=\"spi-fake\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{spi_settle_mode}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Consultas de status por desfecho",
      "description": "found, not_found (não prova que não liquidou) e failed (falha simulada ou do banco).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (spi_query_result) (rate(spi_status_queries_total{job=\"spi-fake\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{spi_query_result}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Comportamento do simulador",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Modo de liquidação em vigor",
      "description": "1 no modo ativo (SPI_SETTLE_MODE ou SpiAdminService.SetBehavior).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (spi_settle_mode) (spi_behavior_settle_mode{job=\"spi-fake\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{spi_settle_mode}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Consultas de status falhando",
      "description": "1 = GetSettlement devolve UNAVAILABLE por simulação.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 19
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(spi_behavior_fail_status_queries{job=\"spi-fake\"})",
          "legendFormat": "falhando"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latência simulada",
      "description": "Atraso antes de decidir cada Settle.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 19
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(spi_behavior_latency_seconds{job=\"spi-fake\"})",
          "legendFormat": "latência"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Logs e traces",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Logs do spi-fake",
      "description": "Um log por chamada gRPC; o campo trace_id vira link para o trace no Tempo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{service_name=\"spi-fake\"}",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Respostas seguradas recentes",
      "description": "Spans do Settle com spi.held = true: o settlement_id e o transfer_id estão nos atributos.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 28
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"spi-fake\" && span.spi.held = true }",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
